[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0010","text":"────下起来了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0020","text":"不，还没下……不过\n云层很厚，感觉随时都会下起来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0030","text":"嘛，只要上了车就是我们的天下了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0040","text":"……雨"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0050","text":"哇……还是没赶上啊\n伞…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0060","text":"没有\n你呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0070","text":"抱歉，我也没有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0080","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0090","text":"……好，趁还没下大之前跑过去……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100700_01_0100","text":"…………"}]
